{
  "id": "JHN.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 3",
  "verseCount": 36,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ea Nikodemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwanda siispa Farisaayajeega siguura Nikodemu, nea ghoahaaghwa fuga Yahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siisi Gaweesa Yesu eawa ak gwayeesha, “Rabi, aseasa geanali gideaba ang'iing'i guwoosi giinealshoocheanda ak gileabu heeda ASEETA; aba gideaba manda siida ammu gwasin gwadeagwajeesu isinayiin, geaghus siida mideayi sea ASEETA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu ak gwayeesha niny, “Aba huumwa, aba huumwa geayeeshiineey siida iimeebiikta eeji deaba iyeenya ea mayghwadaah sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Nikodemu niny, “Iijea eebiikta eeji siida niheedu? Gayghoamu gideaba gaygabiikta jeeda ghaamwat deaba iyeenya ak geeji?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu ak gwayeesha, “Aba huumwa, aba huumwa, geayeeshiineey, siida iimeejiilana beega ea Guroorooda ea mayghoammu gawa jeeda sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gissijiila saseeda gaba saseeda, nea gisijiila guroorooda gaba Guroorooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adihami ng'eanyi aba gideaba geayeeshiineey, ‘Siida geaghus eebiikta eeji.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeammeeda iissa gagal heeda gasa, ak giyiinyi ghuuta ak ea minali heelleabu ghana heeda gal, ea giduurji siidida sijiila Gurooroodean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Nikodemu niny, “Ng'asheesu iijeagwasa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu ak gwayeesha niny, “Eara ang'iing'i giwoosi giinealshoocheanda Israeli ak ea minali ng'asheesu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa, aba huumwa, geayeeshiineey, aseasa geeruku gida sinalli ak geemuuwu gidaghayi sidaayi; amaduuku agooga ghanyea moamwasi ng'asheega simuuwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iyearukuneegwa ng'asheega badayda ng'eanyiida ak ea moamwasi, abeeda iyearukuneegwa ng'asheega mida humng'eeda gajamwastaan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda siida ghayi nidiyeada ea gawa humng'eeda geaghus Orjeeda Siida ghayi rarang'aana humng'eeda ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji gida ghayi atoasta Musa ichibooda aba dareapcheeda, gwasunu eara Orjeeda Siida gajeatoastunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda siida jea ghamwas niny gayghwanyas eaweega manda muudeanooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ASEETA ghabwariiy ng'eanyiida ea eeyi bwak ea ghoadayda Orjeedaanyi asakaleala, ak abeeda siida wassean mwas niny ea mwaroada ak abeeda ghwanyas eaweega manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ASEETA ghayi moojeakna Orjeeda ghwaan ng'eanyiida, ak goorgweaksa ng'eanyiida, geegasa ghwalaalaan ng'eanyiida aba badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida mwas niny majeergweaksa; nea siidida mamwasaan ea ning'ata girgweaksinda, aba gideaba mamwasa gheawunga Orjeeda assakalealla bea ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak girgweaksinda ea nihi, ghwahidu weeshinda jeeda ng'eanyiida, ak ghabwariiy buuneeda misaneeda ea ghoadaraam weeshinda, aba gideaba sinaweega nyaawa ea munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida sina ng'asheega munyas iissa ghwasit weeshinda, nea ghanyea mayghoan heedeesh aba gideaba gajiidu geataajiit sinaweagaaschi munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siidida sina huumeandean gayghoan heedeesh, ak geesikteawa sinaweagaaschi gideaba ghoawal gheang'da ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ea Yohana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata ng'asheesu gawa Yesu sea ginealangaaschi ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida Yudeya, goobiida hoowa sea ginealangaaschi nea goobaatiisan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda eara Yohana goobaatiisan aba Ainoni, neekeewa Salemu, aba gideaba hoowa gwanda beega saang'a; iissa gaweay buuneeda heeda ak goobaatiisan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida Yohana miyeayaat ghealooniga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghoaptu sheang'nyeeda aba jeeda giinealanga Yohana ea siispa Yahudi aba ng'asheega giimiinnooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iidu gaweay heeda Yohana ak gwayeesha, “Rabi, siida heeta indeawi aba giigheawda Yordani ghayi imuuwu ng'asheagaaschi eara niny ghamneawa goobaatiisan, nea gaweay headaanyi buuneesean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yohana, “Siida moamu ghwanyas gida wassean geaghus dea siitaw leabu humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eara agooga ghoamuuschi amuuwuuni gideaba geayeenyi, aniini meawoosi Gristo, aniini geecheaknean deashoayna niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida mideawa gatmooda bea nyeangiida niny siida geeshi, amaduuku siituupchi siida geeshi, iissa ghamiinaada nea gooleeysiit nea gahoosan muuchi iiyiiy ghuuteaba siidida geeshiin; asi aba sareani hooseaneegeasu niheedu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gammiisa niny gideaba gajea ghaloamwaat ak ea meawoosi aniini ghaloamwaat.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida leabu humng'eeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida leabu humng'eeda eahaweewa sean, nea siida mida badayda ng'eanyiida gaba ng'eanyiida, ak gabaloola ng'asheega ng'eanyiida; nea siidida leabu humng'eedean eahaweewa sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niny iissa gamuuwu ng'asheega dea ea gea iiy, ak ghanyea manda siida mwas muuwuunoadaanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amadu siidida mwas muuwuunoadaanyiin, abeeda eara niny ea niiroor gideaba ASEETA huumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba siida ghayi ajeagu ASEETA iissa gabaloola ng'asheega ASEETA ak ghoadaw guroorooda nea moodeena; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwaabwa ghabwariiy Orjeeda, ak ea niyiin haleanjeeda sean geatindaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida mwas Baleanda gwandeawa eaweega manda muudeanooda; nea siidida moawala gheang'da Baleandean ea mayghwanyas eaweega, abeeda gaygwanda badaydaanyi nyarasta ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
